 Excellent practical and theoretical knowledge of various kitchen stations, including Pastry, Breakfast Service, Hot and Cold Buffets, and high-volume meal service;
 Proficient in Microsoft Office Suite (Word, Excel, PowerPoint, Outlook) and scheduling software;
